OL,3,GNEWSA'My son and other loved ones are
OL,4,Amore than just road death statistics'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose 18-year-old son was killed
OL,7,Fin a road traffic collision has said
OL,8,Fevents remembering loved ones that
OL,9,Ffocus on who they were as people help
OL,10,Fensure they are seen as more than a
OL,11,Fstatistic.
OL,13,FRoad Victim Support Northern
OL,14,FIreland-Donegal is hosting Say Their
OL,15,FName events, giving bereaved families
OL,16,Fan opportunity to celebrate their loved
OL,17,Fones and ensure they are not defined by
OL,18,Fthe circumstances of their deaths.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
