OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'My son and other loved ones are
OL,4,Amore than just road death statistics'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEamonn Karran attended an event in
OL,7,FShantallow, Londonderry, on Thursday
OL,8,Fand spoke about his son Noah, who was
OL,9,Fkilled in a crash in Claudy in 2024.
OL,11,FKarran said the support he has received
OL,12,Fsince Noah's death has been a
OL,13,F"lifeline" for him and his family.
